{
  "id": "making-faces",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Yüz İfadeleri",
    "en": "Making Faces"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "group": "pset",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.py",
  "solution": "solution.py",
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "İki `replace` art arda: `text.replace(a, b).replace(c, d)`.",
      "en": "Chain two `replace` calls: `text.replace(a, b).replace(c, d)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`convert` yazdırmaz, `return` eder; yazdırmak `main`'in işi.",
      "en": "`convert` does not print, it returns; printing is `main`'s job."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef main():\n    text = input(\"Text: \")\n    print(convert(text))\n\n\ndef convert(text):\n    return text.replace(\":)\", \"[happy]\").replace(\":(\", \"[sad]\")\n\n\nmain()\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef main():\n    text = input(\"Text: \")\n    print(convert(text))\n\n\ndef convert(text):\n    return text.replace(\":)\", \"[happy]\").replace(\":(\", \"[sad]\")\n\n\nmain()\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "stdio",
      "cases": [
        {
          "stdin": "Hello :)\n",
          "stdout": "Hello [happy]"
        },
        {
          "stdin": "Goodbye :(\n",
          "stdout": "Goodbye [sad]"
        },
        {
          "stdin": "Hello :) Goodbye :(\n",
          "stdout": "Hello [happy] Goodbye [sad]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "convert",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
            "Hello :)"
          ],
          "returns": "Hello [happy]"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            ":( :)"
          ],
          "returns": "[sad] [happy]"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "no faces"
          ],
          "returns": "no faces"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
